{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ptJjgtzc6FbmSViDG3qdAQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:49.181693+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ptJjgtzc6FbmSViDG3qdAQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>中国科学院上海高等研究院（以下简称“上海高研院”）是由中国科学院和上海市人民政府共建的中央直属科研机构，坐落于上海张江，2008年9月26日成立。</span></span></p><p><span><span>上海高研院以先进光源大科学装置的研制、建设和运行为核心，开展加速器科学、光子科学、能源科学与信息科学领域的原始创新研究和关键核心技术研发，支撑前沿科学研究，为战略性新兴产业提供核心技术和集成技术解决方案。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span><span>硬核实力|国之重器</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>科创争先</span></span></span></p></strong></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海高研院坐拥多台世界级大科学装置，为科研创新提供顶级支撑：</span></span></p><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>（一）国家重大科技基础设施</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>上海同步辐射光源（上海光源）：</span></span></strong><span><span>我国大陆首台中能三代同步辐射光源，是支撑众多学科前沿研究与高新技术研发的大型综合性实验平台，已有34条光束线46个实验站向用户开放，是我国目前服务用户最多、成果产出率最高的大科学装置。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"1.1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/FNqSTO2IqMJ7hQEQulo8YBXib0QW9MDyqZQPpZnkibRLxKQXV7DOs0qSmTvAicABia9ts3ZNicRU74ZR2yc5dX2ckgFmplFMjicHMcfxxliaQvWcy8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><strong><span><span>国家蛋白质科学研究（上海）设施：</span></span></strong><span><span>全球首个生命科学领域综合性大科学设施，集成蛋白质制备、电镜、核磁、质谱、显微成像、分子影像和同步辐射线站等系统。拥有国内唯一蛋白质结构数据库PDB China（继美欧日后国际第4家）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"1.2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/FNqSTO2IqMJegP8oiaAhiauKxsVd9Ua8hBwf6eicZ3m4eE1UxkOaulkJPPbLcRibF9wicJuBic7yg0fxmvEAn56RTickLMxdH65FBoe6vfbDAI5icNE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>上海软X射线自由电子激光装置：</span></span></strong><span><span>我国首台X射线自由电子激光用户装置，也是全球首个覆盖水窗波段的软X射线自由电子激光用户装置，水窗波段综合性能国际领先。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"1.3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/FNqSTO2IqMJ8CeVdHQOgHxrAwtkObqyeU13BGSJM41ZZ97DHOU6DD922vwDGOYFYhic4RuAMYkj21MX1mBicILgL0jnSE9hxhMNAqJvuFnZ84/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>（二）科研成果</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>近年来，上海高研院锚定2035年建成科技强国战略目标，瞄准全面实现“率先行动”计划目标和抢占科技制高点核心任务，围绕国家战略需求，在原始创新和关键核心技术攻关取得一批重大成果：牵头编撰《消费端碳排放研究报告（2024）》，提出国家（区域）消费端碳核算方法；构建国际首个多口径碳核算融合大模型“磐石禹衡碳核算大模型”；建成全球第四、全国唯一的蛋白质结构数据库 PDBc，实现我国本土蛋白质结构研究结果自主审校和管理；成功构建CO</span><sub><span>2</span></sub></span><span><span>驱动的高端化学品低碳技术体系，联合领军企业推进产业化示范；牵头多项6G国际电信联盟国际标准获批结项，引领上海6G移动通信关键技术研发；首次实现7-30THz强场太赫兹辐射与高重频全相干机制原理验证等等，每一项成果都彰显国家科研硬实力！</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span><span>名师领航|良师引路</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>研途致远</span></span></span></p></strong></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海高研院汇聚一批国内外知名专家学者，现有导师209人，在学研究生830人，师生比1:4，提供精细化、个性化指导。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/FNqSTO2IqMIOWOJtB4siaYicJd6mBeBpzxBJZe50ycw8SPG6MqOJ0DDuicB9ulDQCInfpFViaWeNl2GHEGe5wmlia5gcySgRNO73b86tibDfZ9PTc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span>招生方向涵盖物理学、化学、电子科学与技术、信息与通信工程、化学工程与技术、核科学与技术等多个学科，以及电子信息、材料与化工、生物与医药等专业学位领域，总有一个方向契合你的科研追求！</span></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>全链培养|多维赋能 研有所成</span></strong></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学位贯通：</span></span></strong><span><span>“硕士—博士—博士后”全链条培养，6个一级学科博硕士点、2个博士后流动站，夯实成长根基。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"3.1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/FNqSTO2IqMI5npPpyfM3ic39UPF0vP1FFW6xCXFoITdlDbYnEP2KM4ySEwR6ta5HG37sOibXcM970RwWyz3T3K0F3N2nURQe8hMWrV90fUMpo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><strong><strong><span>科研实践：</span></strong></strong><span>深度参与国家重点研发计划，依托大科学装置与企业合作平台，提升创新与动手能力。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><strong><span>完善奖助：</span></strong></strong><span>覆盖国家及各类奖学金、助研津贴，享受医保与年度体检，安心科研无顾虑。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"3.2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/FNqSTO2IqMJQldXNVrmQroict4ezv79nhdC78xF2g2b4KlyTz25l3AamHdN7ZLlYuaoTO1OtIHsJfqrlv1t5FaWhoUqK6ug2OWlhnV73SrqQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>学子风采|青春逐梦 未来可期</span></strong></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>研究生在各类科研竞赛中屡获佳绩，</span><span><span>学术能力与创新潜力得到充分认可。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>毕业生专业素养深厚，深受国内外高校、科研机构及知名企业青睐，就业前景广阔。</span></span></p><p><span><span>课余生活同样精彩：完善的宿舍配套、健身房、气膜体育馆，12个社团，特色品牌活动丰富，科研与生活双向奔赴！</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/FNqSTO2IqMLRV5hwtto4ua1vwVc3ZeXSTafP39Y4S1FLJ3ficREuRXHRHwbHebj3dPe1IlzvK3aTc82X3OHHsytBRP899hc8GkWib8jYdjSwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><section><ul><li><p><span><span><span>2021届毕业生邓宇超博士学位论文《过渡金属催化烯烃/烷烃官能团化构筑C-C键的研究》，被评为2022年度中国科学院优秀博士学位论文</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section><section><img alt=\"4.2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/FNqSTO2IqMLTNkS6vPpTnQKmUP8P6h4CSJfONUDuNkIMAZR0HMHQuDiaEOoBLQvX6BGoupnR